<view class="events-page ab-safe-bottom">
  <view class="events-topbar">
    <view class="events-brand">
      <image
        wx:if="{{!brandLogoFailed}}"
        class="events-brand__crest"
        src="/assets/brand/ab-club-crest.png"
        mode="aspectFit"
        alt="AB Club 盾徽标志"
        aria-label="AB Club 盾徽标志"
        binderror="onBrandLogoError"
      />
      <view wx:else class="events-brand__fallback" aria-label="AB Club 标志加载失败，显示文字标识">AB</view>
      <view class="events-brand__copy">
        <text class="events-brand__name">AB Club</text>
        <text class="events-brand__note">GLOBAL CHINESE CLUB</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <button class="events-directory-chip" bindtap="openCityDirectory" hover-class="events-press" aria-label="查看全球七国十三城目录">
      <text>7 国</text>
      <text>13 城</text>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="events-hero" aria-role="region" aria-label="AB Club 全球活动发现">
    <text class="events-kicker">GLOBAL GATHERINGS · PHASE 01</text>
    <text class="events-hero__title">在城市与艺术之间，留下一次值得赴约的相遇。</text>
    <text class="events-hero__copy">活动是数字名片连接后的轻量延伸。第一阶段不做活动交易、商户入驻或报名闭环，只展示少量策展方向与全球城市入口。</text>
    <view class="events-hero__meta" aria-role="note">
      <text>一期轻量预览</text>
      <text>艺术 · 收藏 · 商业 · 城市文化</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="events-section" aria-role="region" aria-label="城市活动方向预览">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view>
        <text class="section-heading__eyebrow">SELECTED GATHERINGS</text>
        <text class="section-heading__title">精选活动方向</text>
      </view>
      <ab-evidence-label mode="{{runtimeMode}}" />
    </view>

    <text class="events-section__lead">三场本地策展样稿，用来确认活动内容与视觉方向；不代表真实排期、场地确认、合作关系或城市节点已运营。</text>

    <view wx:if="{{offlineDemo}}" class="demo-notice" aria-role="note">
      <text class="demo-notice__label">DEMO_ONLY</text>
      <text>本地图片与合成文案仅作方向预览，不会冒充真实活动或报名能力。</text>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="events-loading" aria-role="status">正在读取公开活动信息…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{events.length}}" class="event-list">
      <ab-event-card
        wx:for="{{events}}"
        wx:key="eventId"
        event-id="{{item.eventId}}"
        title="{{item.title}}"
        summary="{{item.summary}}"
        city-name="{{item.cityName}}"
        time-label="{{item.timeLabel}}"
        timezone="{{item.timezone}}"
        state-label="{{item.stateLabel}}"
        registration-label="{{item.registrationLabel}}"
        origin="{{item.origin}}"
        verification-state="{{item.verificationState}}"
        cover-src="{{item.coverSrc}}"
        cover-alt="{{item.coverAlt}}"
        detail-available="{{item.detailAvailable}}"
        bind:open="openEvent"
      />
    </view>
    <ab-event-state
      wx:else
      kind="{{stateKind}}"
      title="{{stateTitle}}"
      description="{{stateDescription}}"
      detail="{{stateDetail}}"
      action-label="查看全球城市覆盖"
      bind:action="openCityDirectory"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="city-explorer" aria-role="region" aria-label="七国十三城筛选与入口">
    <view class="section-heading section-heading--city">
      <view>
        <text class="section-heading__eyebrow">GLOBAL CITY DIRECTORY</text>
        <text class="section-heading__title">从一座城市开始</text>
      </view>
      <text class="city-explorer__count">7 国 · 13 城</text>
    </view>
    <text class="events-section__lead">选择国家浏览首发城市。城市列入目录仅用于名片归属和活动方向探索，不等于当地节点已经运营。</text>

    <scroll-view class="country-filter-rail" scroll-x="true" enable-flex="true" show-scrollbar="false" aria-label="按国家筛选城市">
      <view class="country-filter-list">
        <button
          wx:for="{{countryFilters}}"
          wx:key="id"
          class="country-filter {{item.selected ? 'country-filter--selected' : ''}}"
          data-country-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="selectCountry"
          hover-class="events-press"
          aria-label="{{item.label}}，{{item.count}} 座城市{{item.selected ? '，当前已选择' : ''}}"
        >
          <text>{{item.label}}</text>
          <text>{{item.count}}</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="city-preview-grid">
      <button
        wx:for="{{cityPreviews}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="city-preview"
        data-city-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="openCity"
        hover-class="city-preview--pressed"
        aria-label="查看 {{item.name}} 城市目录；当前不代表节点已运营"
      >
        <view class="city-preview__media">
          <image
            wx:if="{{!item.imageFailed}}"
            class="city-preview__image"
            src="{{item.imageSrc}}"
            mode="aspectFill"
            lazy-load="true"
            alt="{{item.imageAlt}}"
            aria-label="{{item.imageAlt}}"
            data-index="{{index}}"
            binderror="onCityImageError"
          />
          <view wx:else class="city-preview__fallback ab-image-fallback" aria-role="img" aria-label="{{item.name}}本地城市图片加载失败">
            <text>AB</text>
            <text>本地图片暂不可用</text>
          </view>
          <view class="city-preview__shade"></view>
          <text class="city-preview__region">{{item.regionName}} · {{item.countryName}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="city-preview__body">
          <view>
            <text class="city-preview__name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="city-preview__name-en">{{item.nameEn}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="city-preview__arrow">›</text>
        </view>
      </button>
    </view>

    <button class="city-directory" bindtap="openCityDirectory" hover-class="city-directory--pressed">
      <text>查看 7 国 13 城覆盖范围</text>
      <text>完整目录 ›</text>
    </button>
  </view>

  <view class="events-policy" aria-role="note">
    <text class="events-policy__eyebrow">PHASE 01 BOUNDARY</text>
    <text class="events-policy__title">一期以名片为核心，活动保持轻量。</text>
    <text>活动报名、支付、签到、主理人招募、商户入驻与交易撮合均不属于第一阶段。</text>
    <text class="events-policy__detail">所有 DEMO_ONLY 内容都应在正式运营资料完成审核后再替换，不从图片或城市目录推断真实活动状态。</text>
  </view>
</view>
